  "steps": [
    "Melt the chocolate and warm the butter. Whisk the egg whites to stiff peaks.",
    "Beat the yolks with the sugar until pale and thick, then beat in the butter and chocolate.",
    "Gently fold this into the whites, alternating with the almond flour.",
    "Pour into a lined 23 cm tin and bake in a preheated oven at 180 °C for 30–35 minutes.",
    "Ganache: melt the chocolate in the microwave and stir in the cream. Spread over the cooled cake and dust with cocoa."
